'''Ogre Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 794
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Ogre Cat
|name2 = Ogre Cat Face
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Ogre Cat Face''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Ogre Cat is a surprisingly decent collab unit, thanks to its anti-Alien kit and Savage Blow. While its cooldown is sluggish and [[Knockback]] [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] isn't too useful, it can help in situations where the Alien enemies push hard and you can KB + [[Slow]] them with this unit.

Exceptionally, this unit has Savage Blow, scaling up Ogre Cat Face's damage to '''38.25K damage''' which is pretty high. Also, he has better stats than [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] in exchange for a slower cooldown.

Due to being a Super Rare, Ogre Cat is unusable in 4 Crown stages, meaning that you still need to resort to options like [[Ancient Egg: N105 (Rare Cat)|Racquet Cat]] and [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]] for anti-Alien CC. While Ogre Cat is a decent unit to have, he shouldn't be your primary anti-Alien crowd controller or attacker.

{{Job|Classification = Midranger & Crowd-Controller}}

