==Trivia==
*Ogre Cat is based on the ''[[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event|Baki]]'' character [[w:c:baki:Yuujirou Hanma|Yuujirou Hanma]], also known as "The Ogre". His Evolved Form references the "Demon Face" formed by Yuujirou's back muscles.
*The name Ogre Cat was first used for [[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Lesser Demon Cat]] in [[The Battle Cats POP!]].

